rl":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T09:37:18Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T09:37:18Z","body":"@GDevSh007 This functionality can be easily achived using an EditorScript/EditorPlugin.\r\n\r\nThis script would toggle the virtual keyboard for script editor. You can update this script to create an editor plugin if you need a dedicated button.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends EditorScript\r\n\r\nfunc _run() -> void:\r\n\tvar script_editor: CodeEdit = EditorInterface.get_script_editor().get_current_editor().get_base_editor()\r\n\tscript_editor.virtual_keyboard_enabled = not script_editor.virtual_keyboard_enabled\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5089722964/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]